{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefectLadderE","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefectLadderE","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefect.n21946982400E_table","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefect.n21946982400E_table","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/WLambdaDefectLadderE.lean#L67-L84","doc":"**Value table — cross-check against the witness.** `n21946982400E n = 21946982400·E(n)` for\n`n = 2..14`; these integers equal `21946982400·` the per-`n` rationals in the ladder witness\n(held-out `n = 12, 13, 14` PASS). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefect.denom_E","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefect.denom_E","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/WLambdaDefectLadderE.lean#L63-L65","doc":"**Denominator — 3rd rung of the `144^k` ladder.** `21946982400 = 7350·144³` (cf. `C`'s `144`,\n`D`'s `50·144²`; all three collected in `WLambdaDefectSubleadingD.denom_ladder`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefect.n21946982400E_vanishes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefect.n21946982400E_vanishes","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/WLambdaDefectLadderE.lean#L58-L61","doc":"**Vanishing at the trivial partitions.** `E(n)` carries the same `n(n−1)` factor as `C(n)` and\n`D(n)`, so the `h⁶` defect coefficient vanishes at `n = 0, 1` — consistent with `Z(1) = 1` exactly. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefect.n21946982400E_expanded","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefect.n21946982400E_expanded","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/WLambdaDefectLadderE.lean#L49-L56","doc":"**Factored = expanded.** The factored form agrees with the ladder witness's degree-9\n`int_coeffs_low_to_high` for `E` (`keystone-wlambda-defect-coeff-ladder.witness.json`). Pure ring\nidentity — the machine-check that the factored and expanded forms are the same polynomial. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefect.n21946982400E","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.WLambdaDefect.n21946982400E","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/WLambdaDefectLadderE.lean#L40-L47","doc":"`21946982400·E(n)` in **factored** form (`21946982400 = 7350·144³`). `E(n)` is the `h⁶`\ncoefficient (3rd ladder rung) of the `W_λ` defect `1 − Z(n)`. Stated cleared of the denominator to\nstay in `ℤ`. Interpolation-derived + held-out validated (`n=12,13,14`); see the file docstring for\nepistemic status. ","signatureChunk":0}]}